    "detailed_description": "<h1>Coming soon - Grunn!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Grey Scout is an atmospheric stealth game set on a rainy island. Step out of your boat, sneak through the lush meadows, and try to rescue as many guarded friends!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442390/extras/a645935ad1bc9503bfd793e8c08be94a.poster.avif?t=1726497557\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442390/extras/a645935ad1bc9503bfd793e8c08be94a.webm?t=1726497557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442390/extras/a645935ad1bc9503bfd793e8c08be94a.mp4?t=1726497557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 15-30 minutes of playtime.<br></li><li> A simple, but dynamic, stealth mechanic.<br></li><li> A lush island to explore.<br></li><li> Cool procedural animations.<br></li><li> 10 friends to find and rescue.<br></li><li> 5 extra collectibles to find.</li></ul>",
